def recaman(n):
    seq = [0]
    seen = {0}
    for i in range(1, n + 1):
        last = seq[-1]
        next_val = last - i
        if next_val > 0 and next_val not in seen:
            seq.append(next_val)
        else:
            seq.append(last + i)
    return seq[n]
```
The Recaman sequence starts at 0; each term is the previous term minus the step index if positive and unused, otherwise plus the index.
